WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.569
Brad: Tristay’s always one step ahead of us.

2
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.991
Danny: We’ve got to find Hopian.

3
00:00:17.992 --> 00:00:20.635
Tina: But we don’t know where to look for him.

4
00:00:20.636 --> 00:00:24.064
Danny: We’ll just have to look everywhere, I guess.

5
00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.601
Tina: We would get lost.

6
00:00:25.602 --> 00:00:28.461
We don’t know our way around Ginormous.

7
00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:31.913
Brad: But Tristay can see us wherever we go.

8
00:00:31.914 --> 00:00:36.380
Tina: And he’s got those evil creatures to help him!

9
00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:40.838
Danny: That’s why we’ll have to use our imaginations.

10
00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:45.443
Brad: Maybe we should try to bring the color back to Ginormous first.

11
00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.441
Tina: What do you mean?

12
00:00:47.442 --> 00:00:48.894
Brad: Think about it.

13
00:00:48.895 --> 00:00:52.574
Brad: Didn’t Hopian say that is how to stop Tristay?

14
00:00:52.575 --> 00:00:58.728
Danny: It is the reason he told us to come to Ginormous.

15
00:00:58.729 --> 00:01:01.052
Bello: Dada. Dada.

16
00:01:01.053 --> 00:01:04.098
Tina: I’m sure he’s fine, Bello.

17
00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:05.959
Danny: Don’t worry, Bello.

18
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.972
We will do everything we can to defeat Tristay.

19
00:01:09.973 --> 00:01:13.564
Danny: That’s what your dad wanted.

20
00:01:13.565 --> 00:01:15.492
Brad: We should act fast.

21
00:01:15.493 --> 00:01:18.193
Tristay might not know that we’re back yet.

22
00:01:18.194 --> 00:01:20.354
Brad: But he’ll find out soon.

23
00:01:20.355 --> 00:01:24.120
Tina: I can’t wait to see the blue return to the ocean.

24
00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:30.574
Danny: Once we do that, the other colors might be easier.

25
00:01:30.575 --> 00:01:36.311
Brad: Look at all that stuff . . . paints, crayons, modeling clay.

26
00:01:36.312 --> 00:01:39.526
Tina: Bello . . . we need your help.

27
00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:40.882
Bello: Help.

28
00:01:40.883 --> 00:01:46.014
Tina: Bello, can you carry the paint cans and brushes?

29
00:01:46.015 --> 00:01:48.975
Brad: All right, everybody carry something.

30
00:01:48.976 --> 00:01:52.469
Danny: Let’s get going!

31
00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:55.054
Brad: So far, so good.

32
00:01:55.055 --> 00:01:59.742
Tina: Yes, I don’t see Tristay’s evil helpers anywhere.

33
00:01:59.743 --> 00:02:05.611
Danny: Let’s get to the ocean and put the magic clay to work.

34
00:02:05.612 --> 00:02:07.729
Brad: We’re here.

35
00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:13.905
Tina: No evil helpers.

36
00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:18.242
Tina: It’s so gray.

37
00:02:18.243 --> 00:02:20.212
Brad: How are we going to do this?

38
00:02:20.213 --> 00:02:22.329
Danny: Let’s think blue thoughts.

39
00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:27.854
Tina: Use our imaginations!

40
00:02:27.855 --> 00:02:31.060
Brad: How is this helping?

41
00:02:31.061 --> 00:02:40.810
Danny: If we think hard, when this clay hits the water, [n3@the whole ocean will turn blue!

42
00:02:40.811 --> 00:02:44.730
Tina: Give it your best throw, Danny!

43
00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:49.446
Danny: Here I go!

44
00:02:49.447 --> 00:02:53.865
Danny: Oh no!
